1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 16=

2
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,140
Is this information reliable?

3
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:20,460
Has Boss Lv really fled?

4
00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:23,620
I heard he and Long Feng
went to Nanyang,

5
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:25,100
leaving us with this mess.

6
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:27,020
Hurry up and burn all these case files.

7
00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:28,380
That loan shark,

8
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:29,020
I have no idea

9
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:30,620
how he managed to win Boss Ren over.

10
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:32,300
He even got into the police force.

11
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:33,540
If this gets investigated...

12
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:35,460
So what if Boss Ren finds out?

13
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:37,260
It's just about some women.

14
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:39,820
You think we're worried
about Boss Ren finding out?

15
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:42,060
I'm afraid that woman
named Mei will find out.

16
00:01:42,420 --> 00:01:43,220
That woman named Mei?

17
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:46,780
Oh no. I think she already knows.

18
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:47,740
Oh, dear.

19
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:49,740
That woman is completely ruthless.

20
00:01:49,740 --> 00:01:50,580
She's terrifying.

21
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:51,860
Hurry up and burn them!

22
00:01:53,100 --> 00:01:53,900
What are you looking at?

23
00:01:54,020 --> 00:01:55,300
Instead of making fun of me, catch them.

24
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:56,420
She's just a woman.

25
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:57,300
We can simply get rid of her.

26
00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:59,020
Why are you two so frightened?

27
00:01:59,020 --> 00:02:00,140
We can't get rid of her.

28
00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:01,020
Why not?

29
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:02,740
Mr. Jing has lost his mind.

30
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:04,100
He's fallen for that woman.

31
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:11,860
Burn these case files if you want.

32
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:12,620
But whatever happens next,

33
00:02:12,620 --> 00:02:14,020
don't drag me into it.

34
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:15,020
Don't worry.

35
00:02:16,380 --> 00:02:17,180
Who's there?

36
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:20,460
Nobody move.

37
00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:26,620
Tell me.

38
00:02:27,140 --> 00:02:29,220
What do you have to do
with these missing women?

39
00:02:35,260 --> 00:02:36,060
Answer me!

40
00:02:36,140 --> 00:02:37,300
We all work for Boss Ren.

41
00:02:37,300 --> 00:02:38,140
How dare you...

42
00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:40,660
Boss Ren sent me to investigate

43
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:42,500
your connections to these women.

44
00:02:42,660 --> 00:02:43,740
If you refuse to talk,

45
00:02:44,260 --> 00:02:45,980
this is what I'll have
to report back to him.

46
00:02:47,220 --> 00:02:49,380
What exactly does Boss Ren want?

47
00:02:49,460 --> 00:02:50,740
Just tell me

48
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:53,140
what kind of business
Lv Mengde is running now

49
00:02:53,260 --> 00:02:55,540
and what happened to these girls.

50
00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:57,220
What happens in the pleasure quarters

51
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:58,460
is hardly worth making a fuss over.

52
00:02:58,740 --> 00:02:59,540
How about this?

53
00:02:59,660 --> 00:03:00,980
Take me to Boss Ren.

54
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:02,060
I'll explain everything to him myself.

55
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:04,080
- Hey, don't do anything rash!
- You think you're worthy of that?

56
00:03:05,380 --> 00:03:05,940
Kong Shun.

57
00:03:06,420 --> 00:03:07,580
Do you remember Lisa?

58
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:09,300
On the Black Cat list,

59
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:10,540
she was assigned to you.

60
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,060
What did you do to her?

61
00:03:14,940 --> 00:03:15,780
Qin Wei.

62
00:03:16,420 --> 00:03:18,020
You certainly had quite an appetite.

63
00:03:18,020 --> 00:03:19,180
You had two cats,

64
00:03:19,420 --> 00:03:21,140
Fang Yun and Li Caixiang.

65
00:03:21,620 --> 00:03:22,340
One disappeared,

66
00:03:22,340 --> 00:03:23,220
and the other committed suicide.

67
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:24,580
What exactly happened?

68
00:03:27,020 --> 00:03:27,940
Jiang Menhu.

69
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,940
You helped them destroy the case files.

70
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:31,220
Were you paid to do it,

71
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:32,900
or did you take part
in the killings too?

72
00:03:35,220 --> 00:03:36,980
Now that Lv Mengde has disappeared,

73
00:03:37,140 --> 00:03:39,540
if you don't distance
yourselves from him,

74
00:03:39,820 --> 00:03:40,740
then these cases

75
00:03:40,740 --> 00:03:42,540
will have to be pinned on you.

76
00:03:42,940 --> 00:03:44,220
Crimes committed in the concessions

77
00:03:44,220 --> 00:03:45,260
reflect badly on the authorities.

78
00:03:45,420 --> 00:03:46,700
You should know better than I do

79
00:03:47,060 --> 00:03:48,940
what the consequences will be.

80
00:03:54,060 --> 00:03:56,140
He recruited some girls

81
00:03:57,100 --> 00:03:58,740
and introduced them to us at salons.

82
00:03:59,220 --> 00:04:01,100
The cats were just code names.

83
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:03,100
They indicated our personal preferences

84
00:04:03,340 --> 00:04:06,820
and kept the bosses from mixing them up.

85
00:04:06,820 --> 00:04:08,340
Then why have they disappeared?

86
00:04:08,620 --> 00:04:09,820
Some of them were disobedient,

87
00:04:10,220 --> 00:04:11,500
so Boss Lv dealt with them.

88
00:04:12,100 --> 00:04:12,940
As for some others,

89
00:04:12,940 --> 00:04:15,340
he went too far with them,

90
00:04:15,620 --> 00:04:16,860
and they ended up dead.

91
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:19,300
They were really just
secret prostitutes.

92
00:04:19,420 --> 00:04:20,620
It wasn't a big deal.

93
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:23,660
They were students,
factory workers, and typists.

94
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:25,500
How did they become prostitutes?

95
00:04:25,620 --> 00:04:26,600
No...

96
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:29,060
That was Boss Lv's selling point.

97
00:04:30,020 --> 00:04:32,860
Discreet girls who didn't
seem like prostitutes.

98
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:34,980
All kinds of cats.

99
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:39,020
Alcohol, money, love, dreams.

100
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:41,140
Boss Lv had plenty of ways

101
00:04:41,340 --> 00:04:43,500
to get whatever type of girl

102
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:44,500
his clients fancied.

103
00:04:46,540 --> 00:04:47,900
You monsters!

104
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:49,380
You deserve to die!

105
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:50,140
Stop!

106
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:55,940
You can vent your anger,

107
00:04:56,020 --> 00:04:57,060
but you can't kill them.

108
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:58,660
Are you protecting them?

109
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:02,980
If you think

110
00:05:02,980 --> 00:05:03,660
killing these three

111
00:05:03,660 --> 00:05:04,740
will make up for the lives lost,

112
00:05:04,860 --> 00:05:05,940
then go ahead.

113
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:09,860
Mr. Jing is right.

114
00:05:10,020 --> 00:05:11,860
The people behind them
haven't shown themselves yet.

115
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:13,220
We need to keep them alive.

116
00:05:19,220 --> 00:05:21,460
According to Kong Shun and Qin Wei,

117
00:05:21,940 --> 00:05:23,220
these missing girls

118
00:05:23,820 --> 00:05:25,340
were probably all
connected to Lv Mengde.

119
00:05:25,620 --> 00:05:28,180
But now that Lv Mengde has disappeared,

120
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:31,340
all we have is that page of the list.

121
00:05:31,540 --> 00:05:32,860
We have no other leads.

122
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:34,620
Who were those girls handed over to?

123
00:05:34,620 --> 00:05:35,780
Where are they now?

124
00:05:36,300 --> 00:05:37,860
How many people are involved?

125
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:39,260
How many powerful groups?

126
00:05:39,860 --> 00:05:41,180
We don't know any of that.

127
00:05:41,700 --> 00:05:43,820
I remember at Dong Zhenglun's
farewell banquet,

128
00:05:43,820 --> 00:05:45,500
when you brought this up,

129
00:05:45,940 --> 00:05:48,300
many Kun Society bosses looked uneasy.

130
00:05:48,980 --> 00:05:49,740
We can make a list

131
00:05:49,740 --> 00:05:51,900
of everyone close to Lv Mengde

132
00:05:51,900 --> 00:05:52,940
and investigate them one by one.

133
00:05:54,260 --> 00:05:55,380
After Dong Zhenglun died,

134
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:57,300
Lv Mengde became his successor.

135
00:05:58,020 --> 00:05:59,700
Those who voted for him back then

136
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:01,660
are probably all involved.

137
00:06:01,940 --> 00:06:02,740
Who were they?

138
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:07,020
Almost everyone.

139
00:06:09,420 --> 00:06:10,220
That's exactly why

140
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:11,500
I've been trying to stop you.

141
00:06:12,620 --> 00:06:13,580
If they die,

142
00:06:13,820 --> 00:06:14,900
you won't survive either.

143
00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:16,300
And if you die,

144
00:06:16,860 --> 00:06:18,340
there'll be no one else like you

145
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:19,380
to pursue this to the end.

146
00:06:19,820 --> 00:06:22,460
Then they'll carry on

147
00:06:22,500 --> 00:06:23,620
as though nothing happened.

148
00:06:23,620 --> 00:06:24,820
I understand what you mean.

149
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:27,180
I can wait.

150
00:06:28,500 --> 00:06:29,500
But right now,

151
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:30,980
we need to figure out

152
00:06:31,020 --> 00:06:32,540
how to make this scandal big enough

153
00:06:33,020 --> 00:06:35,220
to implicate the Kun Society

154
00:06:35,500 --> 00:06:38,620
and force my adoptive father
to abandon them.

155
00:06:39,420 --> 00:06:40,660
Since we can't start

156
00:06:40,660 --> 00:06:42,660
with Lv Mengde's connections,

157
00:06:43,340 --> 00:06:45,020
let's start with Long Feng.

158
00:06:45,660 --> 00:06:46,860
But she's already fled.

159
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:47,900
How can we investigate her?

160
00:06:48,100 --> 00:06:48,980
That's all right.

161
00:06:49,460 --> 00:06:50,420
Kaimeili is still there.

162
00:06:50,660 --> 00:06:52,340
(Kaimeili)

163
00:06:52,340 --> 00:06:53,380
There are so few people here.

164
00:06:53,860 --> 00:06:56,740
Business must be slow lately.

165
00:06:57,020 --> 00:06:57,860
That's only because

166
00:06:57,860 --> 00:07:00,100
there haven't been many
beautiful women like you around.

167
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:02,420
You certainly know
how to flatter a girl.

168
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:04,620
Here, a toast to you all.

169
00:07:10,300 --> 00:07:11,820
Why did you come alone?

170
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:13,060
Why didn't you bring a dance partner?

171
00:07:13,220 --> 00:07:14,860
I'm here to see Boss Lv.

172
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:21,260
Are you his...

173
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:22,400
Cat.

174
00:07:28,900 --> 00:07:30,300
Why so nervous?

175
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:32,020
That's what he called me.

176
00:07:32,620 --> 00:07:34,580
He said I had a wild personality,

177
00:07:34,940 --> 00:07:35,860
like a wildcat.

178
00:07:37,620 --> 00:07:38,780
Come on, let's keep drinking.

179
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:44,900
Mr. Ding.

180
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:48,220
No, Detective Inspector Ding.

181
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:50,780
Has our boss really fled?

182
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:52,060
What else would he do?

183
00:07:52,900 --> 00:07:54,300
He crossed Boss Ren.

184
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:55,860
Was he supposed to wait
to be dumped in the river?

185
00:07:56,820 --> 00:07:58,540
We'll follow your orders.

186
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:04,740
Go get things ready.

187
00:08:04,980 --> 00:08:05,780
I have some questions to ask.

188
00:08:06,580 --> 00:08:07,380
All right.

189
00:08:21,020 --> 00:08:21,980
Did you find them?

190
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:23,780
We've searched every corner,

191
00:08:23,780 --> 00:08:25,300
but we still haven't found those papers.

192
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:27,180
Understood.

193
00:08:28,100 --> 00:08:29,700
Are we going back to Kaimeili?

194
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:32,540
That would spoil the fun.

195
00:08:33,500 --> 00:08:34,740
For now, let Miss Mei

196
00:08:35,500 --> 00:08:37,580
take the stage in this little drama.

197
00:09:03,340 --> 00:09:04,380
I'll call out some names.

198
00:09:04,780 --> 00:09:05,980
If any of you know them,

199
00:09:06,220 --> 00:09:07,380
give me a lead,

200
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:08,540
and I'll let you go.

201
00:09:09,380 --> 00:09:10,580
If you refuse to talk,

202
00:09:12,140 --> 00:09:13,780
you'll each get a lash.

203
00:09:14,700 --> 00:09:16,180
And we'll keep going
until someone talks.

204
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:19,380
Think carefully.

205
00:09:22,700 --> 00:09:25,340
Now I've seen how you collect debts.

206
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:27,900
Did you actually see me
lay a hand on anyone?

207
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:37,180
Chen Ailing, eighteen.

208
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:39,300
Just graduated from high school.

209
00:09:39,620 --> 00:09:40,540
A typist.

210
00:09:41,700 --> 00:09:42,620
Who knows her?

211
00:09:45,340 --> 00:09:46,740
Chen Ailing.

212
00:09:47,700 --> 00:09:48,780
Who knows her?

213
00:09:56,340 --> 00:09:57,700
Speak up! Come on!

214
00:09:57,900 --> 00:09:59,020
I'll talk!

215
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:01,860
She used to be my girlfriend.

216
00:10:01,860 --> 00:10:02,500
Then...

217
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:03,340
Then I fell into debt,

218
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:04,860
so I made her pay off some of it for me.

219
00:10:05,140 --> 00:10:08,220
And then she died.

220
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:10,300
It was the chief of
the downtown police station.

221
00:10:11,100 --> 00:10:12,060
He did it.

222
00:10:16,700 --> 00:10:17,620
Yang Rui.

223
00:10:24,700 --> 00:10:26,940
I'll talk!

224
00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:28,900
She sold pens at a department store.

225
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:30,580
After Boss Lv took an interest in her,

226
00:10:30,740 --> 00:10:31,660
he had me pretend to be a writer

227
00:10:31,660 --> 00:10:32,940
and lure her to Kaimeili.

228
00:10:33,580 --> 00:10:35,780
I don't know where Boss Lv took her

229
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:37,060
afterward either.

230
00:10:37,940 --> 00:10:38,740
You don't know?

231
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:39,900
I really don't know.

232
00:10:42,540 --> 00:10:43,940
Lu Xiaohua.

233
00:10:44,100 --> 00:10:44,900
I'll talk!

234
00:10:44,900 --> 00:10:46,660
She owned a flower shop.

235
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:48,540
Jiang Aiyu.

236
00:10:50,020 --> 00:10:51,660
She's my cousin.

237
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,720
(Complainant: Ding Shoucheng)

238
00:10:55,740 --> 00:10:56,740
Ding Xiang.

239
00:10:57,220 --> 00:10:59,780
She was an accountant I met
while interning at a jewelry store.

240
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:09,600
(Kaimeili)
This is outrageous!

241
00:11:09,620 --> 00:11:10,540
These con artists

242
00:11:10,540 --> 00:11:12,540
have so many ways to deceive people.

243
00:11:12,540 --> 00:11:13,380
If you long for love,

244
00:11:13,380 --> 00:11:14,580
they use love to lure you in.

245
00:11:14,580 --> 00:11:15,500
If you dream of fame,

246
00:11:15,500 --> 00:11:17,100
they tempt you with
a chance to become famous.

247
00:11:17,100 --> 00:11:18,380
Then there are addictive drugs,

248
00:11:18,700 --> 00:11:20,060
debts, and threats to your reputation.

249
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:21,220
There are traps everywhere.

250
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:23,700
They're far more sophisticated
than ordinary traffickers.

251
00:11:24,100 --> 00:11:25,140
Behind all this

252
00:11:25,460 --> 00:11:28,420
is an elaborate,
carefully staged scheme.

253
00:11:33,020 --> 00:11:33,820
Yan Qing?

254
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:38,500
I'm heading back to the police station.

255
00:11:39,100 --> 00:11:39,820
See you later.

256
00:11:40,180 --> 00:11:40,660
All right.

257
00:11:50,500 --> 00:11:51,460
What brings you here?

258
00:11:52,740 --> 00:11:54,820
I came to collect Lisa's photograph.

259
00:11:55,150 --> 00:11:57,180
I overheard your questioning just now.

260
00:11:59,100 --> 00:12:00,500
Was Lisa, like those women,

261
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:02,420
deceived too?

262
00:12:04,340 --> 00:12:07,140
Didn't you say you didn't want to know?

263
00:12:07,420 --> 00:12:08,500
I used to think

264
00:12:09,380 --> 00:12:10,860
that if she'd gone willingly,

265
00:12:11,420 --> 00:12:12,460
I wouldn't ask.

266
00:12:13,580 --> 00:12:15,420
But what if she'd been deceived?

267
00:12:17,700 --> 00:12:19,780
I'm afraid that if I simply
take her away from Shanghai,

268
00:12:20,540 --> 00:12:21,580
she'll resent me.

269
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:25,180
Actually...

270
00:12:27,300 --> 00:12:29,820
She did ask me for help before.

271
00:12:32,100 --> 00:12:32,900
It's just that...

272
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:35,660
I was too afraid to respond.

273
00:12:42,300 --> 00:12:43,100
Lisa.

274
00:12:43,980 --> 00:12:44,780
Yan Qing.

275
00:12:45,220 --> 00:12:46,140
What's wrong?

276
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:51,780
What's wrong? Are you all right?

277
00:12:56,140 --> 00:12:57,260
Let's leave...

278
00:12:58,300 --> 00:12:59,540
Let's leave Shanghai.

279
00:13:00,020 --> 00:13:00,860
All right?

280
00:13:01,500 --> 00:13:02,300
Leave?

281
00:13:02,940 --> 00:13:04,460
What about your dream
of becoming a singer?

282
00:13:07,700 --> 00:13:08,900
I still want it.

283
00:13:11,140 --> 00:13:12,500
But it's beyond my reach.

284
00:13:14,500 --> 00:13:15,420
Didn't you say

285
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:17,660
you had a great opportunity recently?

286
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:18,660
What happened?

287
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:23,860
Just answer me.

288
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:26,900
Would you dare leave Shanghai with me?

289
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:30,540
If you're willing,

290
00:13:31,700 --> 00:13:32,500
then I'll...

291
00:13:43,700 --> 00:13:44,580
I'm sorry.

292
00:13:46,300 --> 00:13:47,820
I've had too much to drink.

293
00:13:55,300 --> 00:13:56,380
I forgot.

294
00:13:57,740 --> 00:14:01,420
You came to Shanghai to make
a name for yourself too,

295
00:14:01,900 --> 00:14:03,220
to become a famous reporter.

296
00:14:04,980 --> 00:14:08,100
There's no reason for you
to follow a mere singer like me

297
00:14:09,340 --> 00:14:10,500
and start all over again.

298
00:14:11,180 --> 00:14:11,980
Lisa.

299
00:14:12,540 --> 00:14:13,780
That's not what I meant.

300
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:17,180
I don't blame you.

301
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:20,540
I really don't.

302
00:14:22,140 --> 00:14:23,540
When she asked me for help,

303
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:26,420
I was too afraid to face it.

304
00:14:28,100 --> 00:14:29,780
I foolishly believed

305
00:14:30,380 --> 00:14:31,700
that only by staying in Shanghai

306
00:14:31,700 --> 00:14:33,660
could we have the life we wanted.

307
00:14:34,380 --> 00:14:35,860
We've questioned everyone.

308
00:14:36,140 --> 00:14:38,060
Like the other girls,

309
00:14:38,180 --> 00:14:41,540
Lisa was also connected to Lv Mengde.

310
00:14:45,420 --> 00:14:46,340
Lv Mengde?

311
00:14:46,740 --> 00:14:47,820
Once I find him,

312
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:49,900
I'll make sure you get
the answers you deserve.

313
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:51,500
Take me with you.

314
00:14:52,540 --> 00:14:54,380
I want to question him myself.

315
00:15:17,700 --> 00:15:18,500
Boss Ren.

316
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:21,700
Have you found him?

317
00:15:22,220 --> 00:15:23,020
Not yet.

318
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:36,660
We've discovered that Lv Mengde
had his own organization

319
00:15:37,140 --> 00:15:38,700
dedicated to luring women

320
00:15:39,420 --> 00:15:41,500
for the pleasure of Kun Society bosses.

321
00:15:44,500 --> 00:15:45,300
Secret prostitutes?

322
00:15:45,620 --> 00:15:46,420
No.

323
00:15:46,900 --> 00:15:50,180
They were controlled through
alcohol, drugs, money,

324
00:15:50,380 --> 00:15:52,420
and even emotional manipulation.

325
00:15:52,780 --> 00:15:54,580
They were victims forced into it,

326
00:15:54,620 --> 00:15:55,740
not prostitutes.

327
00:15:59,100 --> 00:16:00,700
Then, with Lv Mengde gone,

328
00:16:01,100 --> 00:16:03,420
who's running this organization now?

329
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:07,700
It was originally run by

330
00:16:07,700 --> 00:16:08,980
Long Feng, the boss lady of Kaimeili.

331
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:12,100
But she's disappeared too.

332
00:16:16,580 --> 00:16:17,700
What a coincidence.

333
00:16:26,620 --> 00:16:29,220
I'll take care of this matter.

334
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:33,020
You've worked hard.

335
00:16:52,020 --> 00:16:52,860
See you tonight.

336
00:17:02,300 --> 00:17:03,380
You don't have to do that.

337
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:06,340
I never waste my time on women.

338
00:17:07,100 --> 00:17:07,900
Oh?

339
00:17:10,780 --> 00:17:12,620
I'm only interested in money.

340
00:17:13,340 --> 00:17:14,140
Have a seat.

341
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:15,460
Let's talk business.

342
00:17:19,900 --> 00:17:21,020
I'm all ears.

343
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:28,400
(List)

344
00:17:29,740 --> 00:17:32,300
My list is far more
complete than theirs.

345
00:17:33,100 --> 00:17:34,060
If you want it,

346
00:17:35,100 --> 00:17:36,580
I'll deliver it to you immediately.

347
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:38,460
You're certainly straightforward.

348
00:17:40,380 --> 00:17:42,100
But when it comes to working together,

349
00:17:42,780 --> 00:17:44,940
there has to be something
in it for both sides.

350
00:17:45,620 --> 00:17:46,660
Name your terms.

351
00:17:48,100 --> 00:17:49,820
I want the Kuang family's docks.

352
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:55,100
After all the trouble Lv Mengde caused,

353
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:58,820
Kuang Jinpeng's
tobacco business is ruined.

354
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:01,900
Yoshida has bought his factory,

355
00:18:02,620 --> 00:18:05,460
and now you want his docks.

356
00:18:06,140 --> 00:18:08,380
You're driving him into a corner.

357
00:18:08,580 --> 00:18:10,100
Do you feel sorry for him?

358
00:18:13,700 --> 00:18:15,180
I'm warning you

359
00:18:16,020 --> 00:18:19,620
to beware of what
a desperate man might do.

360
00:18:20,340 --> 00:18:21,940
You could end up getting hurt yourself.

361
00:18:24,940 --> 00:18:26,580
I have my own ways of dealing with him.

362
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:28,820
Since you've agreed to protect me,

363
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:30,820
whatever I take over

364
00:18:31,020 --> 00:18:32,460
will ultimately be yours.

365
00:18:33,060 --> 00:18:34,580
It's worth a try.

366
00:18:36,140 --> 00:18:37,580
What do we have to lose?

367
00:18:38,770 --> 00:18:41,680
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

368
00:18:42,330 --> 00:18:45,300
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

369
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:48,720
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

370
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:50,690
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

371
00:18:50,690 --> 00:18:52,240
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

372
00:18:52,250 --> 00:18:54,200
♪But I refuse to fall♪

373
00:18:54,210 --> 00:18:59,240
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

374
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:01,730
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

375
00:19:02,770 --> 00:19:05,730
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

376
00:19:06,100 --> 00:19:08,980
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

377
00:19:08,990 --> 00:19:11,900
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

378
00:19:12,460 --> 00:19:15,340
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

379
00:19:15,340 --> 00:19:18,760
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

380
00:19:20,050 --> 00:19:22,660
♪Those who have hurt me♪

381
00:19:23,310 --> 00:19:25,990
♪I choose to pierce through♪

382
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,160
♪To tear apart♪

383
00:19:29,270 --> 00:19:35,240
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

384
00:19:36,800 --> 00:19:38,780
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

385
00:19:38,790 --> 00:19:41,800
♪Nor bow to power♪

386
00:19:41,800 --> 00:19:44,240
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

387
00:19:46,010 --> 00:19:49,660
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
